      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "動画、っていうと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020020,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』向けのPR動画！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020030,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "審査通るにはファン数も重要なんでしょ？\r\n私のファンも、引っ張ってこない手はないなって",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "既に固定客がついてるっていうのは、\r\nMEMちょの大きなアドバンテージだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しっかり活用していこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "悪い\r\n本来俺から提案しなきゃいけないところを……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020040,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "わーっ、そういうのじゃなくてぇ\r\nただの癖だから、すぐ動画撮ろうとするの",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020050,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "私のチャンネルに上げちゃっていい？\r\nそれとも２８３プロのチャンネルの方がいいのかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "問題なければ、アップ自体は\r\nうちのチャンネルの方がいいかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こっちに上げて、MEMちょのチャンネルからは\r\n導線を引いてもらうのが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020060,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "私のファンと同時に、２８３プロについてるファンにも\r\nアピールできる？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020070,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "わーい、許可がいただけるならぜひ～！\r\n新規開拓の可能性、嬉しいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020080,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、２８３さん",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、今すごい個人事業主感が出てる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020090,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "褒めてる？　貶してる！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "褒めてるよ！\r\n改めて、すごいしっかりしてるなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020100,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "えー？\r\nじゃあしっかりついでに聞いちゃうけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020110,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "まずはショート動画で知ってもらって\r\nある程度馴染んできたら長めの動画を撮ろうと考えてて──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020110"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00344",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200,
    "bgEffectTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（目標に対して自分が取れる道をすぐ考えて、\r\n実行しようとしてる）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（得意分野をいかすことに躊躇いがないし、\r\n提案も素直に受け入れてくれるから話しやすい）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（何より初動から的確だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1600,
    "bgEffectTime": 1100
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020120,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "……？\r\nプロデューサー、聞いてる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、すまん\r\n聞いてるよ、MEMちょのプランで問題ないと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020130,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "！　よかった！\r\nありがとう！　じゃあ準備進めるね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、頼んだ\r\n必要なものとか手伝いとか、遠慮なく申請してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020140,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "はーい！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──それにしても",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うかうかしてたら俺の仕事がなくなりそうだ\r\nMEMちょは自分のプロモーションが上手い",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020150,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あはは\r\nそりゃあまぁひとりでやってた期間は長いし",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020160,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "──でも、今は違うでしょぉ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！\r\n二人三脚ができると嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "だから任せてくれ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "そうじゃないと",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "一緒に進んでいこう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから任せてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "頼もしい～！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はははっ\r\nMEMちょは盛り上げるのも上手だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020180,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "おお！？\r\nその反応は社交辞令だと思ってるアレだな！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020190,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "言葉通り受け取ってよぉ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020200,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "本音で言ってるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うちに来てもらった意味がないもんな\r\nしっかり仕事はするから安心してほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020210,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "ずいぶんビジネスライクな対応だねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020220,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "プロデューサーいい人だなっていうのも\r\n普通に思ってるのに",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがたい評価だなぁ\r\n裏切らないように頑張るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020230,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "真面目～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
