    "text": "一緒に進んでいこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020240,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "いまさら！\r\nこっちだって最初からそのつもりでーす",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020250,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "頼りにしてますよぉ？\r\n『W.I.N.G.』の経験豊富な敏腕プロデューサーさん？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！\r\nそう言われると緊張しちゃうな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001020260,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あはっ、私もこういう大会初めてで緊張してるから、\r\nその意味でも二人三脚だ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300102/1803001020260"
  },
  {
